  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "When an avatar uses an animation that sets all renderers to inactive upon entering the AFK state, you can no longer exit the AFK state. The AFK parameter remains stuck as true (visible via Avatar Debug), even though the VRChat AFK icon disappears from the HUD. You can exit the AFK state if at least one renderer remains active.",
